        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "The Future of Pattaya’s Walking Street",
        "main_title": "Pattaya Walking Street: Thailand’s Most Famous Walking Street",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Pattaya’s infamous red-light area has come a long way since we first visited in 2009. And, the good news is that it will keep improving.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "In July 2018, the Thai government decided to beautify the street to give it a more ‘family-orientated feel’. By the end of 2020, Pattaya Walking Street will get a makeover to make it more appealing to families.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Pattaya Walking Street: Thailand’s Most Famous Walking Street",
        "main_title": "Pattaya Walking Street: Thailand’s Most Famous Walking Street",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
